# Corpus LFS paths are intentionally narrow.  The old cards_*.jsonl glob also
# matched 16 historical ordinary Git blobs and made fresh worktrees emit false
# "should have been pointers" warnings.  Add each new immutable batch family here.
# Historical merged v9-v11 payloads were already published through LFS.  Keep
# their exact paths smudgeable, but do not auto-track future merged releases:
# new corpus versions must be rebuilt from immutable per-batch files.
